  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :&nbsp;</strong><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/mppsc-assistant-town-planner-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Madhya Pradesh Public Service Commission (MPPSC)</a></span> has recently published the official notification for the posts of Assistant Town Planner (ATP) on its official website. This recruitment has been issued for 39 posts. The online application process for MPPSC ATP Recruitment 2026 will start from 01 July 2026, and candidates can apply till 31 July 2026. Candidates must check the complete details of MPPSC ATP Recruitment 2026 given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Madhya Pradesh Public Service Commission (MPPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">MPPSC Assistant Town Planner ATP Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">MPPSC Advt No. : 02/2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Out : <strong>02 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>01 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>31 July 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>31 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date :&nbsp;<strong>05 July 2026 to 02 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Exam Date :&nbsp;<strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, Other State :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">MP Reserve Category&nbsp;:&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH (Divyang) : <strong>Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Portal Charges : <strong>Rs. 40/- (Included)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Charges : <strong>Rs. 50/- (Extra)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPPSC&nbsp;ATP Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 January 2027</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per MPPSC Assistant Town Planner ATP Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; color: #0000ff;\"> </span>Tool – <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPPSC&nbsp;ATP 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 39 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40.5639%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.9226%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40.5639%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Town Planner</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.9226%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">10</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.9226%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.9226%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">11</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.9226%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">06</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.9226%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">08</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>MPPSC ATP Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have 04 Years Bachelor Degree in Planning&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong>&nbsp;PG Degree in Town / Urban / Regional / Housing / Rural / Infrastructure / Transport / Environment Planning, Landscape Architecture, or Urban Design from any recognized University in India will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">AITP Exam Passed.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPPSC ATP Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://mppsc.mp.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the MPPSC before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other  Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for MPPSC Assistant Town Planner ATP recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे ।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPPSC ATP Recruitment 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Personal Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" c